# Madd Lines design system

Master UI rule for this project. Topic details live in scoped rules:

- **Header scroll pill** → `site-header.mdc`
- **Product circle controls** → `mobile-floating-circle-buttons.mdc`
- **Home stack / hero pair / marquee / about-me** → `home-sections.mdc`
- **Gallery + wanna-do cards** → `storefront-listings.mdc`
- **Customize image slots** → `admin-site-images.mdc`

## Rule hierarchy

Brand constraints in **this file override** any Apple HIG recommendation. Use HIG as a review checklist only — not as a reason to add iOS chrome, tab bars, SF Pro, accent colors, or heavy glass.

## Brand (do not override)

- Palette from `frontend/src/styles/base.css` (`--color-*`). **Three colors only:** background pink, white, black. No second/darker pink.

| Role | Token | Hex |
|------|-------|-----|
| Background / surface / card / image fill | `--color-bg` | `#ECC8D8` |
| Paper (footer, fields on footer) | `--color-paper` | `#FFFFFF` |
| Text / black / primary fills | `--color-text` | `#3D2A32` |
| Highlight / surface / card | aliases | `var(--color-bg)` |
| Accent | `--color-accent` | `var(--color-text)` |
| Type on black fills | `--color-on-ink` | `var(--color-paper)` |

- Product image stages and other image fillers use `--color-product-image-bg`, which aliases `--color-bg`.
- Body and headings use `--color-text` on the pink canvas. White is only footer paper, type on photography, or type on black fills.
- Footer sits on `--color-paper`. Use ink-on-white rules for dividers and fields — do not paint `--color-border` (pink-tinted) on the white footer. Soft rounded pink/white join; no decorative ornaments or heavy drop shadow.
- Primary buttons are black (`--color-text`) with white type (`--color-paper`).
- Editorial sharp corners: `--radius-sm: 0` on page chrome. **Exception:** circular icon controls (`border-radius: 50%` on `ProductFloatingCircleButton`).
- System sans stack (`--font-sans`), not SF Pro imports.
- Soft blush editorial aesthetic — restrained materials, not iOS chrome or heavy glassmorphism.
- **All-lowercase type:** no capital letters on the site. See `typography-lowercase.mdc`. Never `text-transform: uppercase` / `capitalize` or `font-variant: small-caps`.

## Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Use |
|------------|-----|
| **768px / 769px** | Storefront header inset / type scale. See `site-header.mdc`. |
| **640px** | Product UI, mobile storefront pass, parallax, `mobile-safe-*` insets. `useMediaQuery('(max-width: 640px)')`. |

Do not use 640px for header nav layout. Do not use 768px for product gallery or overlay logic.

## Touch & layout

- **Minimum tap target:** 44×44px on mobile (`ProductFloatingCircleButton--lg` for close).
- Use `mobile-safe-container` / `--mobile-safe-inset-x`; `mobile-safe-bleed` for full-bleed media.
- `touch-action: manipulation` and `-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent` on interactive controls.

## Materials & controls

- **Frosted floating controls:** extend `ProductFloatingCircleButton` — never duplicate in one-off buttons. See `mobile-floating-circle-buttons.mdc`.
- Circle buttons and header controls keep frosted/normal shadow on focus — **never** `box-shadow: var(--focus-ring)`.

## Motion

- Short ease transitions (~0.15–0.26s). Always `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`.
- Parallax only via `useScrollParallax` / `useSectionBackgroundParallax`.
- **Storefront header:** compact three-link pill (`artist` / `portfolio` / `contact`), constant see-through glass, `--nav-scroll` only for float offset. See `site-header.mdc`.

## Content & images

- Prefer `SmartImage` for photos.
- Skeleton placeholders over spinners for content loads.

## Vue / CSS conventions

- Vue 3 SFCs; composables in `frontend/src/composables/`
- Scoped styles: extend shared tokens and components over copying CSS blocks
- Accessibility: descriptive `aria-label` on controls; icons `aria-hidden`

## When adding UI

```vue
<!-- ✅ Extend shared control -->
<ProductFloatingCircleButton icon="expand" placement="stage-enlarge" aria-label="View full size" />

<!-- ❌ One-off frosted circle -->
<button class="my-random-circle-btn">...</button>
```

## Design review checklist (HIG-inspired)

Use when auditing UI — **filtered through brand above**:

1. **Accessibility** — contrast ≥4.5:1 for body text, 44px tap targets on mobile, screen reader labels, don't rely on color alone
2. **Visual hierarchy** — consistent spacing, clear type scale, restrained materials
3. **Interaction** — loading/empty states, action feedback, confirm destructive actions
4. **Content** — concise labels, **all lowercase** (never sentence case or title case)

**Do not apply from HIG:** SF Pro, bottom tab bars, Liquid Glass-heavy UI, platform chrome, mandatory dark mode, iOS navigation patterns.

## Mobile product UI (≤640px)

On visual-only refactors, do not change routing, swipe handlers, lightbox open/close logic, cart behavior, or gallery index state unless explicitly asked.

Key files: `ProductDetail.vue`, `ProductDetailOverlay.vue`, `ProductImageGallery.vue`, `MobileFullscreenImageViewer.vue`.
